{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202624uDc0jZya1795642619.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>希臘一艘貨輪上月在黑海遇襲，部分貨櫃被沖到保加利亞海岸，當局強調不構成污染。</p><p></p><p>保加利亞當局在城鎮察雷沃，發現一個貨櫃在岸邊擱淺，內有80多箱聖誕裝飾，總值約5萬歐元。據報相關貨物屬於羅馬尼亞一間公司，而貨櫃來自一艘希臘貨輪，由以色列公司租用。</p><p></p><p>該艘貨輪原定從以色列駛往羅馬尼亞，上月28日途徑保加利亞專屬經濟區，遭無人機襲擊，18名船員包括4名烏克蘭人獲救，外界質疑是俄羅斯所為，俄方否認施襲。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T22:16:23.635675+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T17:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T20:57:34.026880+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T22:09:42.062280+00:00","content_hash":"df628c89f3b54fce57a31616298e7025b6821ad980d911b441a91998c9e08399","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T22:16:23.635675+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}